"│  1004      …    │   Ctrl-C           Close a dialog or cancel the request; twice quits             │                 │"
"│  2001      …    │   L                Show or hide the log pane                                     │                 │"
"│                 │   W u              Arm or disarm writes (read-only until then); the ledger       │                 │"
