"│                 │   Up Down k j      Move                                                          │                 │"
"│                 │   PgUp PgDn        A page up or down                                             │                 │"
"│                 │   Home End g G     The first or last row                                         │                 │"
"│                 │   / s S            Filter (Esc clears it); sort by the next column; reverse      │                 │"
"│                 │   x                Disconnect, or cancel a connection attempt                    │                 │"
"│                 │   Esc              Clear the filter, or a notice                                 │                 │"
"│                 │ Who-Is form (d)                                                                  │                 │"
"│                 │   Tab Up Down      Next or previous field                                        │                 │"
"│                 │   Left Right Space Change the scope                                              │                 │"
"│                 │   Enter Esc        Send (again past a warning); close                            │                 │"
"│                 │ Commands (:)                                                                     │                 │"
"│                 │   watch DEVICE OBJECT [PROPERTY]                                                 │                 │"
"│                 │                    Watch a property (present-value by default); w for short      │                 │"
